1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,470
Go outside before you check your phone. Here's why.

2
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:07,981
Morning light tells your body clock it's time to wake up.

3
00:00:08,931 --> 00:00:12,160
One. It helps you feel more awake and in a better mood.

4
00:00:13,110 --> 00:00:16,258
Two. It can help you fall asleep more easily at night.

5
00:00:17,208 --> 00:00:21,610
Three. Five to ten minutes outside is enough, even on cloudy days.

6
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:26,581
Bonus. Pair it with a short walk, or your morning glass of water.

7
00:00:27,531 --> 00:00:30,503
Do you get morning sunlight? Tell me in the comments.

8
00:00:32,153 --> 00:00:34,914
Follow me for more health and wellness content.

